        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we operated 456 sales centers strategically located in North America, Europe and Australia, from which we sell swimming pool supplies, equipment and related leisure products, irrigation and landscape maintenance products and hardscapes, tile and stone products.",
        "start_character": 357,
        "end_character": 643
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Going forward, we expect to continue to realize sales growth through market share gains and continued expansion of our product offerings with a focus on our proprietary and exclusive brands, such as our recently expanded Regal, E-Z Clor, SuperPro and PoolStyle lines.",
        "start_character": 16176,
        "end_character": 16443
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we sell algaecides and pest control products that are regulated as pesticides under the Federal Insecticide, Fungicide and Rodenticide Act and various state pesticide laws.",
        "start_character": 41569,
        "end_character": 41754
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Operating in a fragmented industry, we add considerable value by purchasing products from a large number of manufacturers and then efficiently distributing the products with high levels of customer service on conditions that are generally more favorable than our customers could obtain on their own.",
        "start_character": 1087,
        "end_character": 1386
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the last several years, we have increased our product offerings and service abilities related to commercial swimming pools.",
        "start_character": 22916,
        "end_character": 23044
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The desire for consumers to enhance their outdoor living spaces with water-sensing and battery-powered alternatives, hardscapes, lighting and other outdoor living-related products provides us with additional future growth opportunities, and we continually add products to take advantage of technological advancements and the development of sustainable, energy-efficient and more aesthetically attractive products.",
        "start_character": 2030,
        "end_character": 2443
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These tools offer real-time integration into our enterprise resource planning system, creating efficiencies in our business processes and provide our customers graphical catalog presentation in the same platform.",
        "start_character": 13436,
        "end_character": 13648
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also function as a day-to-day resource by offering product and market expertise to serve our customers’ unique needs.",
        "start_character": 12614,
        "end_character": 12734
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide uniquely tailored advertising programs through our EDGE Marketing Portal that include features such as digital marketing, customer lead generation, personalized websites, brochures, direct mailers, marketing campaigns and business development training.",
        "start_character": 11983,
        "end_character": 12251
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also work closely with our vendors to develop programs and services to better meet the needs of our customers and to concentrate our inventory investments.",
        "start_character": 29257,
        "end_character": 29415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-074833",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-074833-6477a1d2912dd0df",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-074833",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that ongoing investments in digital transformation and technology help us provide best-in-class service to our customers by improving the customer experience, enhancing our existing customer relationships and expanding our customer base.",
